            <title>[IGNITE-3105] .NET: ContinuousQueryAbstractTest.TestCallback fails sporadically</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3105</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
